hero__standfirst">
<p>Discover life in the technology and design hub of the Netherlands and explore the best places to live in Eindhoven.</p></div><div class="av2-byline"><div class="av2-byline__person"><img class="av2-byline__avatar" src="https://admin.expatica.com/nl/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/chiara-caporale-150x150.jpg" alt="Chiara Caporale" width="44" height="44" loading="lazy"><div class="av2-byline__col"><span id="byline-label-written-by-chiara-caporale" class="av2-byline__label">Written by</span><button type="button" class="av2-byline__name av2-byline__trigger" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="byline-bio-written-by-chiara-caporale" aria-describedby="byline-label-written-by-chiara-caporale"><span class="av2-byline__nametext">Chiara Caporale</span><svg class="av2-byline__caret" viewBox="0 0 12 8" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M1 1.5 6 6.5l5-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></button><div id="byline-bio-written-by-chiara-caporale" class="av2-bylinecard" style="display:none;"><div class="av2-bylinecard__head"><img class="av2-bylinecard__avatar" src="https://admin.expatica.com/nl/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/chiara-caporale-150x150.jpg" alt="" width="48" height="48" loading="lazy"><p class="av2-bylinecard__name">Chiara Caporale</p></div><p class="av2-bylinecard__bio">Growing up between Italy and the US, Chiara took her first flight at just three months old.</p><a class="av2-bylinecard__link" href="https://www.expatica.com/authors/chiara-caporale/">Full profile <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div></div><!----><div class="av2-byline__meta"><span class="av2-byline__label">Last updated</span><time class="av2-byline__name" datetime="2025-12-11T16:29:09">11 December 2025</time></div><div class="av2-byline__actions"><div class="av2-share"><button type="button" class="av2-share__trigger" aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="true"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="18" cy="5" r="3"></circle><circle cx="6" cy="12" r="3"></circle><circle cx="18" cy="19" r="3"></circle><path d="m8.6 13.5 6.8 4M15.4 6.5 8.6 10.5"></path></svg> Share</button><div class="av2-share__menu" style="display:none;"><!--[--><button type="button" class="av2-share__item">LinkedIn</button><button type="button" class="av2-share__item">Facebook</button><button type="button" class="av2-share__item">WhatsApp</button><button type="button" class="av2-share__item">X</button><!--]--></div></div><div class="av2-save"><button type="button" class="av2-save__trigger" aria-pressed="false"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 21l-7-5-7 5V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path></svg> Add to reading list</button><!----></div></div></div></div><div class="av2-hero__media"><img src="https://admin.expatica.com/nl/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2023/11/eindhoven-1536x1024.jpg" alt="Eindhoven" width="1200" height="900" fetchpriority="high"></div></section></div><div class="av2-body"><div class="av2-shell av2-grid"><aside class="av2-rail"><div class="av2-rail__sticky"><nav class="av2-toc" aria-label="On this page"><p id="av2-toc-label-v-0-0-4-0" class="av2-toc__label">On this page</p><div class="av2-toc__window" role="group" aria-labelledby="av2-toc-label-v-0-0-4-0" tabindex="0"><ul class="av2-toc__list"><!--[--><li><a class="av2-toc__link" href="#overview">An overview of Eindhoven</a></li><li><a class="av2-toc__link" href="#h-preparing-financially-for-your-move">Preparing financially for your move</a></li><li><a class="av2-toc__link" href="#housing">How to find housing in Eindhoven</a></li><li><a class="av2-toc__link" href="#neighborhoods">Neighborhoods in Eindhoven</a></li><li><a class="av2-toc__link" href="#centrum-bergen">Centrum</a></li><li><a class="av2-toc__link" href="#strijp">Strijp</a></li><li><a class="av2-toc__link" href="#woensel">Woensel</a></li><li><a class="av2-toc__link" href="#stratum">Stratum</a></li><li><a class="av2-toc__link" href="#gestel">Gestel</a></li><li><a class="av2-toc__link" href="#tongelre">Tongelre</a></li><li><a class="av2-toc__link" href="#geldrop">Geldrop</a></li><li><a class="av2-toc__link" href="#neighborhoods-to-avoid">Neighborhoods to avoid in Eindhoven</a></li><li><a class="av2-toc__link" href="#tips">Tips on choosing a neighborhood in Eindhoven</a></li><li><a class="av2-toc__link" href="#useful-resources">Useful resources</a></li><!--]--></ul></div></nav><!----><section class="av2-newsletter"><span class="av2-newsletter__eyebrow">Newsletter</span><h2 class="av2-newsletter__heading">Moving abroad?</h2><p class="av2-newsletter__body">Sign-up for the latest guides and expat news</p><form class="av2-newsletter__form"><div class="av2-newsletter__honeypot" aria-hidden="true"><label for="av2-newsletter-website-v-0-0-4-1">Website</label><input id="av2-newsletter-website-v-0-0-4-1" value="" type="text" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></div><label class="av2-newsletter__label" for="av2-newsletter-email-v-0-0-4-1">Your email</label><input id="av2-newsletter-email-v-0-0-4-1" value="" type="email" required placeholder="Your email"><button type="submit">Subscribe</button></form><p class="av2-newsletter__consent">By joining us, you confirm that you&#39;re over 16 years old and have read our <a href="/privacy-statement/" class="">Privacy Policy</a>. </p><div class="av2-newsletter__turnstile"></div></section><!----></div></aside><div class="av2-article"><div class="ad-slot ad-element flex text-center justify-center mb-8" id="exp_new_about_dfp_a_lb_bb" name="about_alpha"></div><div class="av2-article__content"><!--[--><!--[--><!----><div>



<p>You may know Eindhoven for being the birthplace of Philips, but this vibrant and lively city has so much more to offer. Besides being a technology hub for businesses, it&#8217;s home to top design, a vibrant cultural scene, and a large student population. </p>



<p>Therefore, it&#8217;s no surprise that this city is a popular choice for expats. Whether you are working at one of its numerous tech companies or studying, Eindhoven has something for everyone. Find out about where to live when moving to Eindhoven in the following sections:</p>






<div class="presentation-card">
    <div class="presentation-card-content">
        <h3 class="title">ABN AMRO</h3>
        <p class="description">Are you an expat looking to buy a house in the Netherlands? While the process may be different from what you&#8217;re used to, ABN AMRO is here to help. You can use their online mortgage calculator or make an appointment with a mortgage advisor. With ABN AMRO, buying a house may be much easier than you thought.</p>
                <div style="text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 8px;">
        <a href="https://www.abnamro.nl/en/personal/mortgages/applying-for-mortgage/mortgage-for-expats.html?utm_source=ExpaticaSP-100616" target="_blank" rel="sponsored noopener" class="read-more presentation-card__cta">
            <p style="white-space: nowrap; color:#000000;" class="m-0 text-black">Go to website</p>
            <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://admin.expatica.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/ico-external-link.svg" width="12" height="16" class="boxout-img" alt="">
        </a>
</div>
