</div><!--]--><!--[--><!----><div><h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="overview">An overview of Eindhoven</h2>



<p>Eindhoven, the Netherlands&#8217; fifth-largest city, is located in North Brabant in the south of the Netherlands. Despite its southerly location, it&#8217;s well-connected by public transport and is home to Eindhoven Airport, the country&#8217;s second-largest airport.</p>



<p>This city is ideal if you&#8217;re keen to live somewhere that blends modernity with a small-town feel. It&#8217;s home to many tech companies and startups ,which contrast with the charming architecture of the historic city center, such as Markt Square and Sint-Catharinkerk (St. Catherine&#8217;s Church).</p>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1800" height="1200" src="https://admin.expatica.com/nl/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/1970/01/cycling-graffiti.jpg" alt="A woman on a bike cycling past a mural in an underpass" class="wp-image-7578" srcset="https://admin.expatica.com/nl/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/1970/01/cycling-graffiti.jpg 1800w, https://admin.expatica.com/nl/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/1970/01/cycling-graffiti-300x200.jpg 300w, https://admin.expatica.com/nl/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/1970/01/cycling-graffiti-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://admin.expatica.com/nl/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/1970/01/cycling-graffiti-768x512.jpg 768w, https://admin.expatica.com/nl/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/1970/01/cycling-graffiti-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://admin.expatica.com/nl/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/1970/01/cycling-graffiti-380x253.jpg 380w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1800px) 100vw, 1800px" /><figcaption class="wp-element-caption">Photo: Tayla Kohler/Unsplash</figcaption></figure>



<p>With a population of almost <a href="https://www.statista.com/statistics/862755/total-population-of-eindhoven/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">250,000</a> and seven main districts, many expats also reside here. It has plenty of international companies and two universities: the Design Academy Eindhoven and Eindhoven University of Technology (TU Eindhoven).</p>



<p>The city is also famous for hosting the annual Dutch Design Week, one of the largest events of its kind in Europe.</p>



</div><!--]--><!--[--><div class="ad-slot ad-element flex text-center mb-8 ad-slot" id="exp_new_about_dfp_c_lb_bb" name="about_charlie"></div><div><h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="h-preparing-financially-for-your-move"><strong>Preparing financially for your move</strong></h2>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img decoding="async" src="https://admin.expatica.com/de/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2017/04/wise-account-40-currencies-euro-768x256-1.webp" alt="Wise multi currency account offers 40+ currencies in one account." class="wp-image-6501" loading="lazy"/></figure>



<p>Moving to Belgium involves managing your finances across borders, from transferring rental deposits to paying monthly expenses in euros. When making international money transfers, it&#8217;s worth understanding the difference between the mid-market exchange rate and the rates typically offered by banks. The mid-market exchange rate is the midpoint between the buy and sell prices of two currencies—essentially the &#8220;true&#8221; exchange rate you see on financial news sites, with no markup added.</p>



<p>Payment institutions like <a href="https://wise.com/nl/account/?utm_source=expatica-com&amp;utm_medium=affiliate&amp;utm_campaign=guides&amp;utm_content=be/moving/location/https://wise.com/be/account/?utm_source=expatica-com&amp;utm_medium=affiliate&amp;utm_campaign=guides&amp;utm_content=nl/moving/location/where-to-live-in-eindhoven-100616" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wise</a>, which is licensed by the National Bank of Belgium, use the mid-market exchange rate for international transfers with transparent, upfront fees. This means you can see exactly what you&#8217;re paying before you send money, helping you manage your finances more effectively during your move to Antwerp. You can check the <a href="https://wise.com/nl/pricing/?utm_source=expatica-com&amp;utm_medium=affiliate&amp;utm_campaign=guides&amp;utm_content=be/moving/location/https://wise.com/be/account/?utm_source=expatica-com&amp;utm_medium=affiliate&amp;utm_campaign=guides&amp;utm_content=nl/moving/location/where-to-live-in-eindhoven-100616" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">full fee structure on Wise&#8217;s website</a> to understand the costs involved in your specific transfer.</p>



<div class="wp-block-expatica-cta-buttons flex flex-wrap items-center w-full font-grold-medium justify-center gap-4 mt-0 mb-4">
<a href="https://wise.com/nl/account/?utm_source=expatica-com&amp;utm_medium=affiliate&amp;utm_campaign=guides&amp;utm_content=be/moving/location/https://wise.com/be/account/?utm_source=expatica-com&amp;utm_medium=affiliate&amp;utm_campaign=guides&amp;utm_content=nl/moving/location/where-to-live-in-eindhoven-100616" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center text-center leading-none transition-colors duration-200 bg-[#00cba8] hover:bg-[#00b397] text-white rounded-xl font-bold no-underline pt-4.5 pb-3.5 px-8 text-lg" target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored noopener">Learn more about Wise</a>
</div>



</div><!--]--><!--[--><div class="ad-slot ad-element flex text-center mb-8 ad-slot" id="exp_new_about_dfp_e_lb_bb" name="about_echo"></div><div><h2 class="wp-block-heading" id="housing">How to find housing in Eindhoven</h2>



<p>If you have decided to move to Eindhoven, there are many different ways to find housing. You can independently search for accommodation or go through a real estate agent. </p>



<p>Students can browse the Eindhoven University of Technology&#8217;s <a href="https://www.tue.nl/en/education/become-a-tue-student/housing" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">guide for internationals looking for housing</a>. You can also join groups on social media where users share rooms and apartments to rent in the city.</p>



<div class="interal-link-wrapper">
            <div class="img-left">
            <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://admin.expatica.com/nl/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2023/11/housing-netherlands.jpg"  alt="#" width="217" height="144">
        </div>
            <a href="https://www.expatica.com/nl/housing/housing-basics/housing-netherlands-139876/" aria-label="Housing Housing in the Netherlands" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
    <div class="content-right">
            <p class="category-name">Housing</p>
