":81,"medium-height":282,"medium_large":273,"medium_large-width":83,"medium_large-height":283,"large":273,"large-width":85,"large-height":284,"1536x1536":273,"1536x1536-width":278,"1536x1536-height":279,"2048x2048":273,"2048x2048-width":278,"2048x2048-height":279,"mobile-image":273,"mobile-image-width":278,"mobile-image-height":279},97,194,495,661,{"id":17,"count":132,"description":286,"name":287,"slug":288,"parent":43,"acf":289,"frontend_template":14},"Enjoy your love life in the Netherlands: make connections, discover first-date etiquette, learn how to organize a wedding, and navigate change with ease.","Love, Marriage &amp; Partnership","love",{"icon_image_article_category":12,"menu_label_categories":13},{"id":291,"count":5,"description":292,"name":293,"slug":294,"parent":21,"acf":295,"frontend_template":14},14,"Manage your money in the Netherlands like a pro: find out how to transfer funds internationally, where to borrow and invest, and how to plan your estate.","Money Management","money-management",{"icon_image_article_category":12,"menu_label_categories":13},{"id":10,"count":54,"description":297,"name":298,"slug":299,"parent":54,"acf":300,"frontend_template":14},"Embark on your adventure in the Netherlands with ease, with basic country insights, moving tips, and detailed guidance on visas and immigration.","Moving","moving",{"icon_image_article_category":301,"menu_label_categories":298},{"ID":302,"id":302,"title":303,"filename":304,"filesize":305,"url":306,"link":307,"alt":308,"author":67,"description":13,"caption":13,"name":309,"status":69,"uploaded_to":54,"date":310,"modified":311,"menu_order":54,"mime_type":72,"type":73,"subtype":74,"icon":75,"width":256,"height":312,"sizes":313},3567,"Icon moving","Icon-moving.svg",1910,"https://admin.expatica.com/nl/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2023/11/Icon-moving.svg","https://admin.expatica.com/nl/icon-moving/","expatica moving","icon-moving","2023-11-28 16:00:42","2024-07-01 07:28:22",40,{"thumbnail":306,"thumbnail-width":79,"thumbnail-height":314,"medium":306,"medium-width":81,"medium-height":315,"medium_large":306,"medium_large-width":83,"medium_large-height":316,"large":306,"large-width":85,"large-height":317,"1536x1536":306,"1536x1536-width":256,"1536x1536-height":312,"2048x2048":306,"2048x2048-width":256,"2048x2048-height":312,"mobile-image":306,"mobile-image-width":256,"mobile-image-height":312},84,169,431,575,{"id":319,"count":28,"description":320,"name":321,"slug":322,"parent":10,"acf":323,"frontend_template":14},17,"Get ready for a smooth relocation to the Netherlands with a handy moving checklist and details on how to relocate all your belongings, hassle-free.","Relocation","relocation",{"icon_image_article_category":12,"menu_label_categories":13},{"id":325,"count":138,"description":326,"name":327,"slug":328,"parent":28,"acf":329,"frontend_template":14},18,"Renting is a popular accommodation choice for internationals in the Netherlands. Find out where to search for a place and understand your rights as a tenant.","Renting","renting",{"icon_image_article_category":12,"menu_label_categories":13},{"id":331,"count":35,"description":332,"name":333,"slug":334,"parent":21,"acf":335,"frontend_template":14},19,"Plan your dream retirement in the Netherlands: get insights on Dutch pensions, savings, healthcare, and finding the best spot to live your golden years.","Retirement","retirement",{"icon_image_article_category":12,"menu_label_categories":13},{"id":312,"count":132,"description":337,"name":338,"slug":339,"parent":93,"acf":340,"frontend_template":14},"Be your own boss! Find out how to freelance or start your own business in the Netherlands, including how to manage the administrative basics of self-employment successfully.","Self-Employment","self-employment",{"icon_image_article_category":12,"menu_label_categories":13},{"id":47,"count":291,"description":342,"name":343,"slug":344,"parent":10,"acf":345,"frontend_template":14},"Immerse yourself in society in the Netherlands by learning about its rich history, its attitudes towards religion and diversity, and its most famous inventions.","Society &amp; History","society-history",{"icon_image_article_category":12,"menu_label_categories":13},{"id":347,"count":131,"description":348,"name":349,"slug":350,"parent":51,"acf":351,"frontend_template":14},21,"Get active on the Netherlands’ sports and fitness scene: discover the popular sports, follow the national teams, and find the best spots to keep fit.","Sports &amp; Fitness","sports-fitness",{"icon_image_article_category":12,"menu_label_categories":13},{"id":353,"count":28,"description":354,"name":355,"slug":356,"parent":21,"acf":357,"frontend_template":14},22,"Demystify taxes in the Netherlands and learn to navigate the fiscal system with clarity whether you’re an employee, a freelancer, or a business owner.","Taxes","taxes",{"icon_image_article_category":12,"menu_label_categories":13},{"id":359,"count":235,"description":360,"name":361,"slug":362,"parent":51,"acf":363,"frontend_template":14},42,"Explore the Netherlands’ must-see activities and destinations, uncover top attractions and natural wonders, and find out what the local families do for fun.","Things to Do","things-to-do",{"icon_image_article_category":12,"menu_label_categories":13},{"id":365,"count":39,"description":366,"name":367,"slug":368,"parent":43,"acf":369,"frontend_template":14},24,"Explore the Netherlands freely: find out how the locals drive (or cycle!), where to get a car and license, and how the public transportation network works.","Transportation","transportation",{"icon_image_article_category":12,"menu_label_categories":13},{"id":371,"count":325,"description":372,"name":373,"slug":374,"parent":10,"acf":375,"frontend_template":14},25,"Learn how to apply for visas, residence, and citizenship in the Netherlands, whether you are immigrating for love, to find work, as a student, or simply for adventure.","Visas &amp; Immigration","visas",{"icon_image_article_category":12,"menu_label_categories":13},{"id":377,"count":51,"description":378,"name":379,"slug":380,"parent":10,"acf":381,"frontend_template":14},39,"Location, location, location! Discover the appeal of the Netherlands’ main regions and cities, and get detailed insights into what each neighborhood has to offer.","Where to Live","location",{"icon_image_article_category":12,"menu_label_categories":13},{"id":383,"count":35,"description":384,"name":385,"slug":386,"parent":132,"acf":387,"frontend_template":14},26,"Feel secure in the Netherlands with comprehensive information on women’s healthcare, covering everything from fertility and sexual health to maternity care.","Women's Healthcare","womens-health",{"icon_image_article_category":12,"menu_label_categories":13},{"id":93,"count":89,"description":389,"name":390,"slug":391,"parent":54,"acf":392,"frontend_template":14},"Kickstart your career in the Netherlands and explore the Dutch labor market with job listings and advice on job hunting, labor law, and entrepreneurship.","Working","working",{"icon_image_article_category":393,"menu_label_categories":390},{"ID":394,"id":394,"title":395,"filename":396,"filesize":397,"url":398,"link":399,"alt":400,"author":67,"description":13,"caption":13,"name":401,"status":69,"uploaded_to":54,"date":402,"modified":403,"menu_order":54,"mime_type":72,"type":73,"subtype":74,"icon":75,"width":404,"height":77,"sizes":405},3566,"Icon working","Icon-working.svg",4446,"https://admin.expatica.com/nl/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2023/11/Icon-working.svg","https://admin.expatica.com/nl/icon-working/","expatica working","icon-working","2023-11-28 16:00:31","2024-07-01 07:28:26",63,{"thumbnail":398,"thumbnail-width":79,"thumbnail-height":406,"medium":398,"medium-width":81,"medium-height":407,"medium_large":398,"medium_large-width":83,"medium_large-height":408,"large":398,"large-width":85,"large-height":409,"1536x1536":398,"1536x1536-width":404,"1536x1536-height":77,"2048x2048":398,"2048x2048-width":404,"2048x2048-hei