ed successfully!","Failed to save preferences. Please try again.",{"index":939,"checkout":941,"thankYou":954,"contactUs":964,"search":978,"authors":980,"healthInsurance":983,"directory":991},{"moreArticles":940},"More articles",{"yourOrder":942,"listingTitle":943,"period":944,"contactSubtitle":945,"contactResponse":946,"whyChooseUs":947},"Your order","Listing in the Expatica Business Directory","per year","Want to add your listing?","Get in touch with our team and we'll help you get set up in the Expatica Business Directory.",{"heading":948,"feature1":949,"feature2":950,"feature3":951,"feature4":952,"feature5":953},"Why choose us","Connect with local customers: 8/10 of them use a directory","Reach 12 million unique visitors","Get a personalized Expatica listing tailored to your business","Get discovered by millions of expats via the Expatica Directory","Outshine competitors with a featured ad",{"heading":955,"paragraph1":956,"paragraph2":957,"paragraph3":958,"whatHappensNext":959,"step1":960,"step2":961,"step3":962,"step4":963},"Thanks for your order!","We've got everything we need from you. We will first check your information, and have your listing live in a couple of working days.","Should you have any questions please do not hesitate to contact us.","Welcome to our Expatica directory!","What will happen next?","We review your listing and determine the correct category.","Once the listing is approved you will be notified by email","Your listing subscription will be automatically renewed yearly","One month before the scheduled renewal, we will contact you to review results",{"heading":734,"name":965,"email":966,"country":967,"subject":968,"areYou":969,"individual":970,"business":971,"emailConsent":972,"iConsent":973,"message":974,"phoneNumber":975,"successMessage":976,"errorMessage":977},"Name:","Email *","Country","Subject","Are you:","Individual","Business","Check this box if you'd like to receive occasional emails from us regarding interesting news and opportun